{"sourceUrl":"https://mp.weixin.qq.com/s/AQRZ3csKl1aMCfSA-cYa2Q","status":"full","attemptedAt":"2026-11-15T16:55:46.447596+00:00","httpStatus":200,"fetchedUrl":"https://mp.weixin.qq.com/s/AQRZ3csKl1aMCfSA-cYa2Q","html":"<div><section><section><section><section><section></section><section></section><section></section><section></section><section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section></section></section><section><span><br/></span></section></section><section><section><section><p><span><span>为推进研究生多元招生，加强拔尖创新人才选拔、提高研究生生源质量，根据上级教育主管部门相关规定，2027年我院拟接收推荐免试硕士研究生，欢迎各高校优秀学子积极报名！</span></span></p></section></section></section><section><section><span><br/></span></section><section><section></section></section></section></section></section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section><section><section><section><section><section><section><strong><span>0</span></strong><strong><span>1</span></strong></section></section><section><section><section><span><strong><span>招生专业与导师介绍</span></strong></span></section></section></section><section><section><span><br/></span></section></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section></section></section><section><span><br/></span></section></section><section><section><section><p><span><span>2027年，营销与物流管理学院拟接收推免生的专业为：工商管理学（专业代码：120200）。</span></span></p><p><span><span>我院现有硕导25名、博导2名，拥有省“333高层次人才”、中青年科学技术带头人、“六大人才高峰”和“青蓝工程”优秀青年骨干教师等多名，学院师资力量雄厚，导师信息详见学院网站“研究生教育—硕导简介”栏目。</span></span></p><p><span><span>相关网址：</span></span></p><p><span><span>https://yxwl.nufe.edu.cn/yjsjy/sdjj.htm</span></span></p></section></section></section><section><section><span><br/></span></section><section><section></section></section></section></section></section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section><section><section><section><section><section><section><strong><span>02</span></strong></section></section><section><section><section><span><strong><span>报名方式和报名时间</span></strong></span></section></section></section><section><section><span><br/></span></section></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section></section></section><section><span><br/></span></section></section><section><section><section><p><span><span>拟申请免试攻读南京财经大学营销与物流管理学院2027年硕士研究生的优秀应届本科毕业生，可登录“南京财经大学研究生推免系统”。进行预填报，网上申请时间为：即日起至2026年9月17日11：00。</span></span></p><p><span><span>相关网址：</span></span></p><p><span><span>http://yjs.nufe.edu.cn/gsapp/sys/yjsbmxsd/entrance.do</span></span></p></section></section></section><section><section><span><br/></span></section><section><section></section></section></section></section></section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section><section><section><section><section><section><section><strong><span>03</span></strong></section></section><section><section><section><span><strong><span>申请条件</span></strong></span></section></section></section><section><section><span><br/></span></section></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section></section></section><section><span><br/></span></section></section><section><section><section><p><span><span>1.中华人民共和国公民。</span></span></p><p><span><span>2.拥护中国共产党的领导，品德良好，遵纪守法。</span></span></p><p><span><span>3.身体健康状况符合国家和学校规定的体检要求。</span></span></p><p><span><span>4.获得本科就读高校推免生资格。</span></span></p><p><span><span>5.无任何学术不端行为记录，无任何不良诚信或违法、违纪行为记录。</span></span></p><p><span><span>6.本科阶段学习成绩突出，专业排名名列前茅。</span></span></p><p><span><span>7.申请专业与申请人本科所学专业，原则上应属相同或相近学科。理工科可报考经管类专业。对于跨一级学科报考者，由学院审定是否符合该专业培养要求。</span></span></p><p><span><span>8.申请人应具有较强的独立调查研究、分析问题、解决问题能力。</span></span></p><p><span><span>在某方面有特殊才能的；专业某方面有一定研究，有公开发表的科研论文或大学生竞赛作品的；或参加社会实践活动并写出具有重要价值的调查报告的；或在全国性竞赛中获较高级别奖项的。上述情况在同等条件下优先录取。</span></span></p></section></section></section><section><section><span><br/></span></section><section><section></section></section></section></section></section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section><section><section><section><section><section><section><strong><span>04</span></strong></section></section><section><section><section><span><strong><span>申请程序</span></strong></span></section></section></section><section><section><span><br/></span></section></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section></section></section><section><span><br/></span></section></section><section><section><section><p><span><span>1.凡符合上述申请条件且有意报考我院推免生的优秀应届本科毕业生，可登录“南京财经大学研究生推免管理服务系统”，填写报名信息并按要求将以下材料（①-④为必须材料）原件的清晰版扫描件或照片在系统内提交：</span></span></p><p><span><span>①《诚信复试承诺书》（须申请人本人签字）；</span></span></p><p><span><span>②本人学生证、有效居民身份证；</span></span></p><p><span><span>③大学本科阶段成绩单（须加盖学校教务处或院系公章）；</span></span></p><p><span><span>④《思想政治素质和品德考核表》（须所在院系党组织填写并加盖公章）；</span></span></p><p><span><span>⑤能够反映英语水平的证明材料；</span></span></p><p><span><span>⑥校级及以上获奖证书或公开发表的学术论文；</span></span></p><p><span><span>⑦其他代表性成果证明材料等。</span></span></p><p><span><span>申请人完成报名后，须在系统生成《南京财经大学接收校外推荐免试研究生意向表》，打印后须本人签字，申请人本科院校相关部门书写意见、签字盖章，将原件的清晰版扫描件或照片再登录上述报名系统于【打印申请材料】处进行上传。</span></span></p><p><span><span>（http://yjs.nufe.edu.cn/gsapp/sys/yjsbmxsd/entrance.do）。</span></span></p><p><span><span>2.复试形式为网络远程复试。学院将指定专人对申请人报名材料进行严格审查并通知复试安排。考生收到复试通知后当天，需登录我校心理健康教育与咨询中心网站完成相关测评。具体操作流程另行通知。</span></span></p><p><span><span>3.经我院考核合格且获得本科就读高校推免生资格者，须于“全国推荐免试攻读研究生（免初试、转段）信息公开管理服务系统”（简称：全国推免服务系统），开通后，按要求填报我院相关专业。我校将通过“全国推免服务系统”发放复试通知和拟录取通知。推免生应在我校规定时间内进行确认。</span></span></p><p><span><span>（全国推免服务系统网址：http://yz.chsi.com.cn/tm）</span></span></p><p><span><span>4.推免生拟录取名单将进行网上公示。公示名单经由上级部门审核后，按要求向教育部备案。拟录取的推免生不再需要参加统考生的网上报名和网上确认。</span></span></p></section></section></section><section><section><span><br/></span></section><section><section></section></section></section></section></section><section><p><span><br/></span></p><section><section><section><section><section><section><strong><span>05</span></strong></section></section><section><section><section><span><strong><span>支持政策</span></strong></span></section></section></section><section><section><span><br/></span></section></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section></section></section><section><span><br/></span></section></section><section><section><section><p><span><span>学校及学院设有完善的研究生奖助体系。推免生入学后可按规定申请学业奖学金、国家奖学金、助学金及各类社会捐赠奖（助）学金等。具体奖助标准与评定办法按上级及学校相关政策执行。</span></span></p></section></section></section><section><section><span><br/></span></section><section><section></section></section></section></section></section><p><span><br/></span></p><section><section><section><section><section><section><strong><span>06</span></strong></section></section><section><section><section><span><strong><span>联系方式</span></strong></span></section></section></section><section><section><span><br/></span></section></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section></section></section><section><span><br/></span></section></section><section><section><section><p><span><span>咨询电话：025-86718480</span></span></p><p><span><span>学院联系人：赵老师</span></span></p><p><span><span>地址：南京财经大学仙林校区德业楼507</span></span></p></section></section></section><section><section><span><br/></span></section><section><section></section></section></section></section></section><p><span><br/></span></p></section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section><section><section><img alt=\"屏幕截图 2026-09-08 180226.png\" loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_png/C4sz9kVVx1m9pddqG17uYBTSribWIkbibiciaCaKnRtSKv1m89icD0U9GEibSLsaAcDqhS7vSicDHZ8siavXyalGb7VHz9dWuaYeQgP5TTYS0owy6tk/640?wx_fmt=png&amp;from=appmsg\"/></section></section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section><section><section><section><section><section><section><span><br/></span></section></section><section><section><section><section><strong><span>END</span></strong></section></section><section><span><br/></span></section></section><section><span><br/></span></section></section></section></section></section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section><p><span><span>来源：营销与物流管理学院</span></span></p><p><span><span>美编：徐晨迪</span></span></p><p><span><span>责编：徐晨迪</span></span></p><p><span><span>审核：赵伟 姚杰 陶经辉</span></span></p></section></section><p></p></div>","textSha256":"debf561575fa86758cfc72bfc617a727d3aa11545cf4135a8bff5b86ab4ff10b","textLength":1699,"sourceSha256":"cb7ccac39e0bbb8087611e71bbaf1b84e92afc36eac6493ec2b87cfb476f81d6","selector":"#js_content","attachments":[],"pdfs":[],"unavailableMedia":[],"id":"syp-f9aea671af629b732be6","title":"2026年南京财经大学营销与物流管理学院关于接收2027年推免生预报名工作的通知","capturedAt":"2026-11-15T16:55:46.447596+00:00"}
